  "content": "<div class=\"p-10 font-sans max-w-4xl mx-auto border border-neutral-300 rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm border-t-4 border-cyan-500\">\n  <div class=\"text-center border-b-2 border-neutral-800 pb-6 mb-8\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-serif font-black text-neutral-900 uppercase tracking-tight\">TERMO DE DISTRATO DE SOCIEDADE LIMITADA COMERCIAL</h1>\n    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 font-mono mt-2 tracking-widest\">DISTRATO MUTUAMENTE AJUSTADO CONFORME REGRAS CIVIS</p>\n    <div class=\"mt-3 flex justify-center\">\n      <span class=\"text-[8px] uppercase font-mono bg-neutral-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 font-bold\">\n        SUB-MÓDULO: CORPORATIVO • ID: amicable-limited-partnership-dissolution\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-6 text-neutral-850 leading-relaxed text-sm text-justify\">\n    <p>Retirada consensual de todos os sócios com a respectiva devolução de capital social faturado.</p>\n    <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-base font-serif font-bold text-neutral-900 border-b border-neutral-250 pt-4 pb-1 uppercase tracking-tight\">1. DO ACORDO</h2>\n      <p>Os sócios fundadores {{distrato_socio_alfa}} e {{distrato_socio_beta}} ajustam em comum acordo a devolução do capital estimado de R$ {{distrato_capital_reajustado}} pondo fim definitivo à união comercial.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-12 mt-16 text-center text-[11px] page-break-inside-avoid\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n      <div class=\"border-t border-neutral-400 w-full pt-1.5\"></div>\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-neutral-950\">{{distrato_socio_alfa}}</p>\n      <p class=\"text-neutral-500 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider\">SÓCIO ALFA</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n      <div class=\"border-t border-neutral-400 w-full pt-1.5\"></div>\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-neutral-950\">{{distrato_socio_beta}}</p>\n      <p class=\"text-neutral-500 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider\">SÓCIO BETA</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
